_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-16T09:37:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T03:50:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3 stable, 4.4 beta 3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - macOS 13.1.0 - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 - Apple M2 (8 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the GDScript editor of the Godot editor, if you write a for loop and write the statement on the same line with a variable (not a function), the variable will be in green, similar to that of a Class, instead of the default variable color.\n\nThe image below (the code is also in the MRP) shows the comparison.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82a392ce-5a75-44b6-9d6b-dee5ea496566)\n\nI'm not sure if this is intended or not, but addressing it will probably reduce potential confusion and increase readibility.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. create a for loop and write the statement on the same line after the colon\n2. make sure that a variable, not a function, directly follows the colon\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18814253/mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102913/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102913/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}